  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Stealth 5 ranks, Infiltration sphere.</p>\n<p>Whenever you perceive a creature that is about to perceive you while you maintain an Infiltration sphere approach, you can spend 1 use of skill leverage to move up to half your speed as an immediate action even if you are not in combat and attempt a new Stealth check to hide. If that creature fails its opposed Perception check against your new Stealth check, it does not notice you in the first place.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/infiltration#toc41\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
